# Citroen CX Series 2 four-door saloon, 1986-1989.
#
# The Series 2 CX, announced in France in July 1985 and on sale in Britain from
# 1986. The saloons were withdrawn in May 1989 and replaced by the XM; the
# estate ran on to 1991. It is the same shell as the Series 1 car with a revised
# front and rear, and was built as a variant of that master.
#
# Dimensions 4.666 x 1.730 x 1.360 m, wheelbase 2.845 m, as the Series 1 car.
# Source: the reference pack's notes.
#
# What differs from Series 1: a wider, flatter nose with a wider grille, revised
# wrap-around bumpers front and rear, four-section ribbed tail lamps, a rear
# spoiler and a less deeply concave rear screen. The cabin, side glazing, low
# wedge and covered rear wheels are the Series 1 master's.
#
# Shape reference: a 1989 CX 22 TRS on an F-registration, seen from near-side
# (about 12 degrees behind the side axis, slightly high and soft), from the
# front three-quarter and from the rear quarter. A true elevation was rendered
# for coherence.
#
# Colours: no British-market colour list was found, so the objects carry plain
# names: silver, blue, grey and red. Weights silver 3, blue 3, grey 2, red 2,
# total 10, provisional pending the central rebase.
#
# Speed 190 km/h and comfort 90/465, as the Series 1 car. Classes 2,3,4.
#
# Dates are road presence: 1986 intro, retires staggered 2000-2003 on a
# fourteen- to seventeen-year tail. Note that the saloon left the British range
# in May 1989; the tail reflects cars remaining on the road.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/citroen-cx-series2.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/citroen-cx-series2.dae (141 objects). References:
# citycars/references/citroen-cx-series2/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the front bumper is less distinct from the body than the
# photograph and the rear spoiler is thicker from the side. At 128 px the low
# wedge, the flatter nose, the ribbed tail lamps and the covered rear wheels
# read as a Series 2 CX.

obj=citycar
name=CitroenCXSeries2(Silver)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=1986
intro_month=1
retire_year=2003
retire_month=6
speed=190
length=3
class=2,3,4
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=90
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=465

